p(f,'你承认了擅自转述。信任恢复了一点。\n道歉没有替对方许下和解。',"You acknowledge sharing without permission. Some trust returns.\nYour apology does not promise reconciliation for them.",'你承认了擅自转述，信任恢复了一点。\n对方有没有答应直接谈，仍按本人原先的答复。',"You acknowledge sharing without asking. Some trust returns.\nTheir earlier answer about talking still stands.")
p(f,'对方听见了需要，原主却失去了对私下话语的决定权。\n你获得了一点亲近，也留下了一次需要承认的越界。',"The listener hears a need. Its owner loses control of private words.\nCloseness comes with a breach you will need to acknowledge.",'收信人听进去了，说这句话的人却没有同意让你转告。\n本人对你的信任下降，也收回了先前的谈话同意。',"The recipient takes it in, but the speaker never agreed to have it shared.\nThey trust you less and withdraw any earlier agreement to talk.")
p(f,'“这比刚才的责备，更像是能回答的一句话。”\n你带来了获准分享的需要，没有替任何人保证结果。',"That sounds like something I can answer.\nYou carry an allowed need, without guaranteeing an outcome.",'“这样说，我就明白了。”\n你把获准转述的那句话送到了。',"That makes more sense to me.\nYou've passed on the words the speaker agreed to share.")
